(4870190, 707309, 3087, '<td valign="top">A lot of coffee shots, this one is my favourite as it works aesthetically as well as in terms of content/ challenge theme. I like the almost black and white nature of it, with that rich dark brown providing such subtle colour.</td>', 'A lot of coffee shots, this one is my favourite as it works aesthetically as well as in terms of content/ challenge theme. I like the almost black and white nature of it, with that rich dark brown providing such subtle colour.', '2008-08-06 12:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
