(4879776, 707155, 96762, '<td valign="top">I get what you were going for "BRIGHT" and early, but it''s just a little toooo bright for my liking.  i think it would have been a great shot if not for this.   Would have voted higher if it wasnt so bright.    good luck to you</td>', 'I get what you were going for "BRIGHT" and early, but it''s just a little toooo bright for my liking.  i think it would have been a great shot if not for this.   Would have voted higher if it wasnt so bright.    good luck to you', '2008-08-11 03:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879780, 706865, 96762, '<td valign="top">this is a cool shot.  It seems a bit "edited" for "basic editing" to me though.  Also, I kind of dont get the shot.  It looks like the razor is going to slice his hand.  What were you going for here?  Wiping off the blade?  "Ready for a shave" doesnt exactly help give anything away for the shot either.   Don''t get me wrong, it''s a great photo and I do like it.  i just dont truly "get" it.  Good luck to you!</td>', 'this is a cool shot.  It seems a bit "edited" for "basic editing" to me though.  Also, I kind of dont get the shot.  It looks like the razor is going to slice his hand.  What were you going for here?  Wiping off the blade?  "Ready for a shave" doesnt exactly help give anything away for the shot either.   Don''t get me wrong, it''s a great photo and I do like it.  i just dont truly "get" it.  Good luck to you!', '2008-08-11 03:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
