(4881054, 706059, 59740, '<td valign="top">Nice try. A little too busy for me. The fence post in the center draws my attention away from the main subject which I assume is the house and truck.</td>', 'Nice try. A little too busy for me. The fence post in the center draws my attention away from the main subject which I assume is the house and truck.', '2008-08-11 17:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881055, 705494, 59740, '<td valign="top">Nice try. Good composition. I would like to see it a little sharper.</td>', 'Nice try. Good composition. I would like to see it a little sharper.', '2008-08-11 17:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881060, 704592, 59740, '<td valign="top">Good idea. the high contrast really makes the cup and pitcher stand out. The only thing that bothers me is the out of focus pitcher. Since it is equal in interest value to the cup it should also be sharp.Maybe a smaller aperture or manual focus would have helped.</td>', 'Good idea. the high contrast really makes the cup and pitcher stand out. The only thing that bothers me is the out of focus pitcher. Since it is equal in interest value to the cup it should also be sharp.Maybe a smaller aperture or manual focus would have helped.', '2008-08-11 17:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881065, 707476, 59740, '<td valign="top">I would have liked your picture a lot more if just the top flower were in focus with the rest totally blurred. There is too much distraction from the other flowers.</td>', 'I would have liked your picture a lot more if just the top flower were in focus with the rest totally blurred. There is too much distraction from the other flowers.', '2008-08-11 17:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881067, 706916, 59740, '<td valign="top">Nice try. The cat blends a little too much with the fence post and I would like to see what it is looking at (or stalking).</td>', 'Nice try. The cat blends a little too much with the fence post and I would like to see what it is looking at (or stalking).', '2008-08-11 17:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
