(4884445, 707466, 41357, '<td valign="top">As my old (and stoned) buddy use to sing<br/> <br/>you can fool some people sometime (<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">posthumous</a>)<br/>but you can''t fool all the people all the time.<br/> <br/>did you take this shot with your cellphone camera?<br/>(inside your pocket?)<br/> <br/>Another picture like that and I''ll have to add you to my Favorites photographers list<br/> <br/>did you see the comment on my pic <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=665040" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41357/120/665040.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41357/120/665040.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41357/120/665040.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-13 02:02:01.</i></td>', 'As my old (and stoned) buddy use to sing you can fool some people sometime ( posthumous)but you can''t fool all the people all the time. did you take this shot with your cellphone camera?(inside your pocket?) Another picture like that and I''ll have to add you to my Favorites photographers list did you see the comment on my pic ', '2008-08-13 01:25:04.000000', '2008-08-13 03:02:01.000000', 0),
