(4885855, 706484, 68586, '<td valign="top">Delightful gentle shot - probably lacks ''punch'' for a challenge entry - this is one that you want to sit back and savour - not have someone flick through hurredly assigning scores to . . <br/> <br/>Just curious why you''ve filed this under ''Self Portrait'' ? Is that actually you in a Deer suit ? If it is your ear''s are bigger than I imagined   :-  P</td>', 'Delightful gentle shot - probably lacks ''punch'' for a challenge entry - this is one that you want to sit back and savour - not have someone flick through hurredly assigning scores to . .  Just curious why you''ve filed this under ''Self Portrait'' ? Is that actually you in a Deer suit ? If it is your ear''s are bigger than I imagined   :-  P', '2008-08-13 13:45:05.000000', NULL, 0),
