(4885921, 706823, 81530, '<td valign="top">This is the type of photo that most people won''t understand because they don''t take the time to think, or because they don''t know how to analyze a photograph. The first thing you do in the morning is open your eyes, and it takes time for them to adjust to the light. No the photograph is not in focus or perfectly composed ... it''s not supposed to be. This is great photo that fits the challenge well.</td>', 'This is the type of photo that most people won''t understand because they don''t take the time to think, or because they don''t know how to analyze a photograph. The first thing you do in the morning is open your eyes, and it takes time for them to adjust to the light. No the photograph is not in focus or perfectly composed ... it''s not supposed to be. This is great photo that fits the challenge well.', '2008-08-13 14:08:02.000000', NULL, 0),
