(4886570, 706865, 77192, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a lovely shot.<br/> <br/>Please offer my sincerest condolences to Warren and wish him the best of health from me and my sweetheart Sara. It can only be devastating to lose your partner of so many years even at that age. But she''ll always be alive in his thoughts and in his heart.<br/> <br/>I wish I hadn''t been quite so flippant with the comment I left during voting. Obviously I couldn''t know what he''d recently been through. I apologise to you and to Warren.</td>', 'Congratulations on a lovely shot. Please offer my sincerest condolences to Warren and wish him the best of health from me and my sweetheart Sara. It can only be devastating to lose your partner of so many years even at that age. But she''ll always be alive in his thoughts and in his heart. I wish I hadn''t been quite so flippant with the comment I left during voting. Obviously I couldn''t know what he''d recently been through. I apologise to you and to Warren.', '2008-08-13 17:40:11.000000', NULL, 0),
