(4906619, 706917, 67145, '<td valign="top">lol .. funny as ... when you said caleb and his bird, in your comment, i was lookin'' for his girlfriend .  !!!<br/>then i noticed mel .. we had a budgie for 8 years, the funniest and cutest little pet ever .. gave us hours of gut busting laughter .. really !! .. he died two or three years ago and i''ve wanted to get another bird ... our little bird who i called ''the little bird'' had a vast vocabulary AND NO SWEAR WORDS .. he used to copy my laugh and that cracked me up .. its bad enough without being copied by a bloody budgie .. anyway .. caleb''s bird, the feathered one, is the sort of bird i was considering instead of a budgie .. thinking that because of the bigger size, and brain, it might be a bit more intelligent  .. altho more intelligence isnt always a good thing .. in birds and ppl .. lol .. :)<br/>anyhooooo . love your pic .. its a brilliant representation of family life .. :)<br/><i>a few minutes later</i> ... read a bit of your answer to MStone .. hey max . you cant please everyone .. when i first opened this i laughed .. its so funny .. being posed never occured to me .. sorry .. lol .. i dont mean to be offensive thinking you''d go get your camera when your youngest is drowning in his cereal .. but mate .. I WOULD .. !!! <br/>anyway .. i think the ppl you''d please with this shot would far outweigh the detractors .. its brilliant .. :)<br/></td>', 'lol .. funny as ... when you said caleb and his bird, in your comment, i was lookin'' for his girlfriend .  !!!then i noticed mel .. we had a budgie for 8 years, the funniest and cutest little pet ever .. gave us hours of gut busting laughter .. really !! .. he died two or three years ago and i''ve wanted to get another bird ... our little bird who i called ''the little bird'' had a vast vocabulary AND NO SWEAR WORDS .. he used to copy my laugh and that cracked me up .. its bad enough without being copied by a bloody budgie .. anyway .. caleb''s bird, the feathered one, is the sort of bird i was considering instead of a budgie .. thinking that because of the bigger size, and brain, it might be a bit more intelligent  .. altho more intelligence isnt always a good thing .. in birds and ppl .. lol .. :)anyhooooo . love your pic .. its a brilliant representation of family life .. :)a few minutes later ... read a bit of your answer to MStone .. hey max . you cant please everyone .. when i first opened this i laughed .. its so funny .. being posed never occured to me .. sorry .. lol .. i dont mean to be offensive thinking you''d go get your camera when your youngest is drowning in his cereal .. but mate .. I WOULD .. !!! anyway .. i think the ppl you''d please with this shot would far outweigh the detractors .. its brilliant .. :)', '2008-08-23 18:51:55.000000', NULL, 0),
